# NOTE: models/*.joblib is intentionally NOT ignored below.
# The trained pipeline file is usually only a few MB for this dataset,
# and Streamlit Community Cloud needs it present in the repo to load the
# app immediately after deployment (no separate "train on deploy" step).
# If your file ever exceeds ~100MB, uncomment the line below and use
# Git LFS or host the model file elsewhere (e.g. Hugging Face Hub) instead.
# models/*.joblib
